Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Storing and retrieving", "Title",
 CellID->1773,ExpressionUUID->"fb26523c-d1c3-4bee-aa8f-d90d36419574"],

Cell["\<\
Every solution lives on disk as an entry: a folder holding the record (a \
compressed association in a .m file) and the notebook that produced it. This \
note walks the full life of an entry: where it lives, how it is named and \
saved, how it is read back, loaded, resumed, shared and published.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1774,ExpressionUUID->"77a3bb1a-aa29-4c7d-aca7-00b594f14b9b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The package is loaded with its canonical initialization cell. The load \
itself is silent by design; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["LocateData"]], 
    "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/LocateData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c7f82724-89d9-48d9-bdf9-bfbb77bd5f1b"],
 " is the display line: it replays the same load panel and Data status on \
every evaluation, so the cell shows identical output however many times the \
front end runs it. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["EnableParallelComputations"]], 
    "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/EnableParallelComputations", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "d4e2231b-7067-4583-9bfc-82076fa4fbea"],
 " lets ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Compute"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/Compute", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "b3f54621-8266-4724-a71f-f815410e96a0"],
 " apply ParallelMap entries across parallel kernels."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1775,ExpressionUUID->"bb9d7bc0-aac5-4183-8897-4edbd75a80c9"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<VasilDimitrov`SolutionsX`\>\"", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"LocateData", "[", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"EnableParallelComputations", "[", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->1776,ExpressionUUID->"55280f0c-a1bf-4953-84f9-117e3823b1da"],

Cell["Data directory, aliases and curation", "Section",
 CellID->1777,ExpressionUUID->"34c30599-21aa-4af9-a067-2a83841b36da"],

Cell["\<\
Three items make up the user configuration \[LongDash] the data directory, \
the alias and the curator flag. They live in one plain file at \
$UserBaseDirectory/ApplicationData/SolutionsX/config.wl, written by the \
setter functions below and read once when the package loads; each Wolfram \
installation carries its own copy:\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->1778,ExpressionUUID->"015a6e99-67a3-40c5-9c96-68af9c4ed58d"],

