Cell["\<\
The most important one for daily usage is the alias; the Welcome notebook \
walks a new user through choosing one permanently. From then on all their \
data entries naturally live in:\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->1792,ExpressionUUID->"fee1d81a-1d7f-4972-bba1-676ca04ff075"],

