Cell["\<\
Additionally, we can get an arbitrary number of other data entries. In the \
present example, aside from the 4d black hole there are two related entries: \
the Fefferman-Graham expansion of the original black hole, and the induced \
solution on a surface of constant z = zc (z being the Fefferman-Graham \
coordinate).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1838,ExpressionUUID->"89bb6e65-adf0-4b12-8262-cf0e8b97737a"],

